`Effect.ensuring` runs its finalizer when the program ends for *any* reason — success, `InBattle` during the fly-in, `NothingHere`, or `HullCritical` from the hunt — and then preserves whatever outcome the body had, so a failure still fails the program. Since `disengage()` never fails and cannot re-surface a failure, this satisfies "whatever happens, disengage at the end" without swallowing anything.

